me":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-14T19:33:33Z","updated_at":"2026-08-18T12:39:24Z","closed_at":"2026-08-18T12:10:34Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122422","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122422.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122422.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-18T12:10:34Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`GDScriptRPCCallable` was introduced in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/53704 at a time were normal `Callable` had no rpc implementation, so a language specific implementation was required.\r\n\r\nSupport in the normal `Callable` was added in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87858 to achieve parity for `Callable(obj, \"some_rpc_method\")`.\r\n\r\nSince the normal callable has RPC support now, there is no need to keep a GDScript implementation that could get out of sync.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n- As per https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87858#pullrequestreview-1927220303 reduz originally intended for rpc to require language specific implementations. I don't agree with that, there is no reason why GDScript should do this. When the only reasonable implementation is delegation to `Node::rpcp`.\r\n- Most stuff in `GDScriptRPCCallable` just delegates to the relevant methods in `Object` and thus is equivalent to normal `Callable`.\r\n- There is a slight difference in the stringification. There will not be an `(rpc)` suffix anymore. I don't think this is critical, especially since this was not consistent between `str(Callable(self, \"rpc_method\"))` and `str(rpc_method)` anyway.\r\n- Equivalence of the old custom callable was based on object+method (through hash) which is semantically equivalent to `Callable`.\r\n- The hash changes, this is not compat breaking since callable hashes aren't stable across executions.\r\n- The ordering through `operator<` would change. That shouldn't be an issue, the only usage I could locate was in `Connection::operator<` ~which seems to be unused?~ Which might influence the order in which they are serialized into scenes. But given that this did previously sort based on hashes that were based on object ids this doesn't seem very stable anyway.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122422/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122422/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}